SUMMARY: Expansion - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Marta Martin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, July 24th\nEvening Dan
 ce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFaci
 litator Marta Martin\n\nIntention: Expansion\n\nAs we move through the sea
 son of expansion\, we are invited to experience awareness and insight. We 
 can begin to expand our love and compassion to ourselves and others. We ca
 n see how joy and suffering\, attachment and abandonment are part of the c
 ycle of our lives.\nAre we ready to access more moments of ordinary magic?
 \n\n## About Facilitator Marta Martín\n\nMarta (she/her/ella) has been pa
 rt of AMC since she moved to Asheville from Surfside\, FL in 2008. She has
  been teaching movement for over 30 years\, using music and movements from
  around the world.\nShe loves to motivate people to find freedom in their 
 bodies so they can dance to the spirit.\nListen to her mixes on Mixcloud (
 [https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingMarta/](https://www.mixcloud.com/DancingM
 arta/) ) and Soundcloud ([https://soundcloud.com/dancingmarta](https://sou
 ndcloud.com/dancingmarta) )\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the da
 nce starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any 
 that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and
  secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\
 nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nV
 OLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to
  volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJ
 pZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFIN
 P8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRU
 E4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of
  the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES
 !\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-
 dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bg
 NhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4
 OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrj
 KIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envision
 s a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic s
 elves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authen
 ticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance wave
 s for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit 
 organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on
  the dance floor!
