SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Esmae
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, July 26th\n1st Dance W
 ave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wav
 e 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitator 
 \\| DJ Esmae \\(Megan Belling\\)\n\nIntention: You Know What to Do\nThere 
 is a dance happening within your body on a cellular level. Rhythm and soun
 d can shape our sleep\, energy\, mood\, and even the way we move. When the
  music begins your body already knows what to do.\n\n## About DJ Esmæ\n\n
 DJ Esmæ (Megan Belling) has been moving in the world of ecstatic dance fo
 r over 13 years and sharing musical journeys as a DJ for the past 5. Her s
 ets weave together tribal rhythm\, texture\, intensity\, and softness in a
  way that invites people back into their heart and home space.\nListen to 
 her mixes at: https://soundcloud.com/djesmae\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please
  note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Openin
 g Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to 
 ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or na
 me your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration 
 Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for 
 free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZX
 h0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgy
 MDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem
 _nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at
  the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING 
 CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance
 /?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDI
 yMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhD
 ttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Co
 llective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be 
 their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are 
 to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by h
 osting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501
 (c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28
 805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
